shares repurchased, your repurchase request and required documentation must be received in good order by 4:00&nbsp;p.m. (Eastern time) on the second to last business day of the applicable month. Settlements of share repurchases will be made within
three business days of the Repurchase Date. The Early Repurchase Deduction will not apply to shares acquired through our distribution reinvestment plan. An investor may withdraw its repurchase request by notifying the transfer agent before 4:00 p.m.
