affected by: (i)&nbsp;competition from other available manufactured housing sites or available land for the placement of manufactured homes outside of established communities and alternative forms of housing (such as apartment buildings and site
built single-family homes) and (ii)&nbsp;local real estate market conditions such as the oversupply of manufactured housing sites </P>
