mean it is no longer in our best interests to qualify as a REIT. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>The failure of a mezzanine loan to qualify as a real estate asset could adversely
