<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Although our investments in real estate-related securities investments will be primarily in <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-distressed</FONT> CMBS and
