<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:8%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Currently, a Private Core+ Account invests in &#147;core+&#148; real estate and real estate-related assets in the United States and Canada
