<P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Unconsolidated Properties Held Through Joint Ventures </I></B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Unconsolidated properties held through joint ventures generally will be valued in a manner that is consistent with the guidelines described above for
