 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We pay the Dealer Manager selling commissions over time as a stockholder servicing fee with respect to our
outstanding Class&nbsp;T shares equal to 0.85%&nbsp;per annum of the aggregate NAV of our outstanding Class&nbsp;T shares. For each Class&nbsp;T share, this stockholder servicing fee consists of an advisor stockholder servicing fee and a dealer
stockholder servicing fee. We expect that generally the advisor stockholder servicing fee will equal 0.65%&nbsp;per annum and the dealer stockholder servicing fee will equal 0.20%&nbsp;per annum, of the aggregate NAV for each Class&nbsp;T share.
