<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Under the Foreign Investment in Real Property Tax Act of 1980 (&#147;FIRPTA&#148;), distributions to a <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-U.S.</FONT> holder
