<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Provided that a <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">tax-exempt</FONT> holder has not held its common stock as &#147;debt-financed property&#148; within the
