<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Notwithstanding the above, however, a portion of the dividends paid by a &#147;pension-held REIT&#148; are treated as UBTI as to any trust which is described
